#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/delivery/next-iterations.md:1
msgid "后续迭代与团队执行"
msgstr "Next iterations and team execution"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/delivery/next-iterations.md:3
msgid "第一阶段：把软件候选变成实板证据"
msgstr "Stage one: turn software candidates into physical evidence"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/delivery/next-iterations.md:5
msgid ""
"当前最高优先级是接入三块首发实际 Board、记录 PCB/晶振/供电/接线，建立 probe、serial 和 waveform/power-cut "
"station。G474、H743、U575 来源参考配置另行核对实际板卡， H743 还需观察供电模式，U575 需在执行镜像前确认 option "
"bytes 与启动状态。 先复核安全初值与 clock，再验证 UART 真 TC、取消、 RX 丢失、watchdog reset、Flash 掉电与"
" EXTI/PWM/ADC。每种 mode 只在实际执行过的 target tuple 上资格化。试验输出保持脱离产品负载，具体现场操作由 "
"station 合同约束。"
msgstr ""
"The highest priority is connecting the three actual launch Boards, recording"
" PCB/crystal/power/wiring, and establishing probe, serial and "
"waveform/power-cut stations. G474/H743/U575 source-reference configurations "
"require separate actual-board checks. H743 additionally needs power-mode "
"observation; U575 requires option-byte/start-state confirmation before "
"running an image. Check safe initial outputs and clock first, then UART true"
" TC, cancellation, RX loss, watchdog reset, Flash power cuts and "
"EXTI/PWM/ADC. Qualify each mode only on actually executed target tuples. "
"Keep trial outputs disconnected from product loads; station contracts govern"
" field actions."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/delivery/next-iterations.md:12
msgid ""
"以同一 candidate ELF 做 cycles、IRQ latency、最长 service 间隔、stack high-water、 "
"丢失、长负载测量。源码／汇编推断只能帮助定位，不写成真实时序结果。需要调整 预算或 provider 时重新生成对应 "
"source/config/artifact 证据。"
msgstr ""
"Use the same candidate ELF to measure cycles, IRQ latency, maximum service "
"interval, stack high-water, loss and sustained load. Source/assembly "
"inference helps locate causes but is not a measured timing result. Budget or"
" provider changes require regenerated source/config/artifact evidence."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/delivery/next-iterations.md:16
msgid "第二阶段：按测量增加能力"
msgstr "Stage two: add capabilities according to measurements"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/delivery/next-iterations.md:18
msgid ""
"F407/F470 已有 UART/SPI 有限 DMA、UART 连续 RX／双向 DMA、ADC 有限／连续 trigger blocks、I2C "
"IRQ／DMA、Classic CAN、USB FS PIO，以及精确软件夹具的 Ethernet、capture 和 complementary "
"PWM。先以实际吞吐、IRQ latency、块间 间隙、line drain 和 overload 测量收敛这些已存在模式；连续模式也不能承诺任意 "
"IRQ 延迟或消费者速度下无丢失。I2C 保持 100 kHz、7-bit address，每条1–256 bytes、 最多8条消息和精确 "
"route；10-bit 或更长事务仍是独立扩展。"
msgstr ""
"F407/F470 already have bounded UART/SPI DMA, continuous UART "
"RX/bidirectional DMA, bounded/continuous ADC trigger blocks, I2C IRQ/DMA, "
"Classic CAN, USB FS PIO and Ethernet/capture/complementary-PWM exact "
"software fixtures. First refine these existing modes with actual throughput,"
" IRQ latency, inter-block gap, line-drain and overload measurements. "
"Continuous modes cannot promise losslessness under arbitrary IRQ latency or "
"consumer speed. I2C remains 100 kHz, 7-bit, 1–256 bytes per message, at most"
" eight messages and exact routes; 10-bit or longer transactions are separate"
" extensions."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/delivery/next-iterations.md:25
msgid ""
"F103/GD303 新增有限 UART channel-DMA、正常 RX block、I2C IRQ 消息及物理 Flash／单次 ADC／固定 "
"PWM；GD303 另维护 EXTI。有限 RX 依赖 owner service 重新装填，必须测量间隙、背压和丢失；I2C priority0 "
"不允许内核通知。GD303 的硬件 timer 级联还需实测跨域 carry 与 Flash 停顿，不能由主机模型推断传播延迟。"
msgstr ""
"F103/GD303 add finite UART channel-DMA, normal RX blocks, IRQ-message I2C "
"and physical Flash/single-shot ADC/fixed PWM; GD303 also maintains EXTI. "
"Finite RX depends on owner service to rearm, so gaps, backpressure and loss "
"require measurement; priority-zero I2C cannot notify a kernel. The GD303 "
"hardware timer cascade also needs physical carry and Flash-stall "
"observations; host models cannot establish bridge propagation delay."

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/delivery/next-iterations.md:30
msgid ""
"G474 新增 ADC1 bulb 单次／TIM6 正常 DMA block、I2C1 polling 和 ECC Flash； "
"必须实测首次转换丢弃、预热、2.5–50 kHz 精确触发范围与真实采样孔径。H743 已维护 有限 UART RX DMA-IDLE、可选已初始化 "
"D2 SRAM1 和七类有限外设；Cache-on DMA 仍要求独占完整 lines，RX 有 service/rearm 间隙，Flash 仅开放 "
"Cache off。U575 TZEN0 已有 SPI/I2C/ADC/PWM/EXTI/Flash 的有限夹具；VDDA/ASV、VDDIO2 与真实"
" 总线电气须单独验收。独立 TZEN1 参考仅新增复制最多八个 PC7 命令的 cooperative job，Secure 私有存储保留状态，NS "
"地址不跨调用保留；没有通用异步借用、RTOS、 双域 factory 或跨域 DMA。芯片事实不授权其他模式、路由或实板资格。 后续顺序与明确退出条件见"
" [SOC-28–36](../design/soc-refinement.md)："
msgstr ""
"G474 adds ADC1 bulb shots/TIM6 normal-DMA blocks, polling I2C1 and ECC "
"Flash; first-conversion discard, warmup, the exact 2.5–50 kHz trigger range "
"and actual sampling aperture require measurement. H743 maintains finite UART"
" RX DMA-IDLE, optional initialized D2 SRAM1 and seven finite peripheral "
"classes. Cache-on DMA still requires exclusively owned complete lines; RX "
"has service/rearm gaps and Flash requires Cache off. U575 TZEN0 has finite "
"SPI/I2C/ADC/PWM/EXTI/Flash fixtures; VDDA/ASV, VDDIO2 and actual bus "
"electrical behavior need separate acceptance. The independent TZEN1 "
"reference only adds cooperative jobs of up to eight copied PC7 commands, "
"retaining state in private Secure storage and no NS address across calls. It"
" supplies no general asynchronous borrow, RTOS, dual-world factory or cross-"
"domain DMA. Chip facts authorize neither additional modes/routes nor "
"physical qualification. See [SOC-28–36](../design/soc-refinement.md) for "
"sequencing and explicit exits:"

